---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout'
import TitlePage from '@/components/TitlePage'
---

<BaseLayout
	title='Sponsor Us'
	description='Sponsor Swift Published and reach an engaged audience of iOS and Swift developers.'
>
	<TitlePage title='Sponsor Us' />

	<div class='prose dark:prose-invert max-w-none mt-8'>
		<p>
			<strong>Swift Published</strong> is a growing platform dedicated to iOS and Swift developers. By
			sponsoring Swift Published, you can showcase your product or service to a highly engaged and niche
			audience of developers who are passionate about building apps for Apple platforms.
		</p>

		<h2>Why Sponsor Swift Published?</h2>
		<p>
			Since its inception, Swift Published has been committed to delivering insights, tutorials, and
			best practices for Swift and iOS development. Sponsoring our platform offers a unique way to
			connect with developers who value high-quality, practical content.
		</p>
		<ul>
			<li>
				<strong>Targeted audience:</strong> iOS developers focused on Swift, SwiftUI, and Apple's development
				ecosystem.
			</li>
			<li>
				<strong>Global reach with an Indian base:</strong> While based in India, our content attracts
				developers worldwide.
			</li>
			<li>
				<strong>Steady growth:</strong> Built by developers for developers — a trusted platform for learning
				and collaboration.
			</li>
		</ul>

		<h2>Sponsorship Packages</h2>

		<h3>1 Week Sponsorship</h3>
		<ul>
			<li><strong>₹5,000 (~$60)</strong></li>
			<li>Your advertisement visible for one week</li>
			<li>
				Appears prominently on the <strong>homepage</strong> and{' '}
				<strong>all blog posts</strong>
			</li>
			<li>A shout-out on our <strong>LinkedIn</strong> and <strong>Twitter</strong></li>
		</ul>

		<h3>4 Week Sponsorship</h3>
		<ul>
			<li><strong>₹20,000 (~$240)</strong></li>
			<li>Includes all benefits of the 1-week sponsorship</li>
			<li>Visible for a full month</li>
			<li>Additional social media exposure and feature in our newsletter</li>
		</ul>

		<h3>Custom Packages</h3>
		<p>
			Looking for a tailored solution? Email{' '}
			<a href='mailto:hello@swiftpublished.in'>hello@swiftpublished.in</a> and we'll design a package
			that works for you.
		</p>

		<h2>Sponsorship Insights and Reporting</h2>
		<p>You'll receive at the end of each sponsorship period:</p>
		<ul>
			<li>
				<strong>Impressions report:</strong> the number of times your ad was displayed
			</li>
			<li><strong>Click metrics:</strong> total clicks generated</li>
			<li>
				<strong>Engagement data:</strong> click-through rate (CTR) so you can evaluate campaign effectiveness
			</li>
			<li>
				<strong>UTM integration:</strong> for traffic attribution in your own analytics tools
			</li>
		</ul>

		<h2>Terms and Conditions</h2>
		<ol>
			<li>
				<strong>Ad content approval:</strong> All advertisements are subject to review and approval by
				the Swift Published team.
			</li>
			<li>
				<strong>Content responsibility:</strong> The advertiser is solely responsible for the accuracy
				and legality of the advertisement.
			</li>
			<li>
				<strong>No liability:</strong> Swift Published is not responsible for issues arising from advertised
				products or services.
			</li>
			<li>
				<strong>Payment terms:</strong> Payment is required upfront to confirm your sponsorship slot.
			</li>
			<li>
				<strong>Non-refundable:</strong> Sponsorship fees are non-refundable once the advertisement goes
				live.
			</li>
			<li>
				<strong>Changes and cancellations:</strong> Change requests must be submitted at least 48 hours
				before the ad goes live.
			</li>
		</ol>

		<h2>Let's Get Started!</h2>
		<p>
			To book a sponsorship slot or for any questions, email us at{' '}
			<a href='mailto:hello@swiftpublished.in'>hello@swiftpublished.in</a>. We'll get back to you
			within 24 hours.
		</p>
	</div>
</BaseLayout>
